===West side===
====Welcome to Kanto!====
When you step out of the water, you draw the attention of a man standing nearby. He asks if you know what you have just done, and excitedly informs you that you have just taken your first step into the [[Kanto]] region.

===Tohjo Falls===
[[Tohjo Falls]] is a small cave in southwest [[Kanto]] that serves to link the two regions together. As it cannot be cleared before obtaining {{HM|07|Waterfall}} and the {{badge|Rising}}, it also acts as a natural barrier so that only the strongest Trainers continue onward to the {{ka|Pokémon League}} at [[Indigo Plateau]].

