===East side===
====A Friendly Gift====
Visit the house outside [[Tohjo Falls]] to meet an elderly woman. After hearing that you are headed to the Pokémon League, she asks if your Pokémon are loyal enough to you. If your lead Pokémon is [[Friendship|friendly]] enough, she rewards you with {{TM|37|Sandstorm}}.

==Route 26==
[[File:Kanto Route 26 HGSS.png|thumb|130px|Route 26]]

{{rt|26|Kanto}} is one of the longest routes in [[Kanto]], and occupies much of the western part of the region. It stretches from {{rt|27|Kanto}} in the far southwest to the [[Pokémon League Reception Gate]] that sits at the crossroads between {{rt|28|Kanto}} to the west, {{rt|22|Kanto}} to the east, and {{ka|Victory Road}} to the north.

