===Rest stop===
Visit the house on the eastern road and speak to the woman inside. Noticing how tired that your Pokémon appear to be, she lets you take a moment to rest, restoring your Pokémon to full health in the process.

===Week Siblings' home===
The house on the edge of the grass patch in the southwest belongs to the [[Week Siblings]]. No one is home, but a note on the table lists each sibling's designated location. Each sibling gives out a different [[type-enhancing item]]. After all seven siblings have been met, they hand out [[List of Ribbons in the games|Ribbons]], as well.

